  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614680376573-df3480f0c6ff?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "MAG (the upgrade resource) is time-gated by the in-game calendar—plan MAG farming dungeons between story deadlines, never on final deadline days. Three calendar days before any story dungeon is the recommended buffer.",
      "Archetype inheritance allows unlocking skills from a previously mastered Archetype in a new one. Master Merchant (requires 15 hours of Merchant Archetype experience) before Chapter 3 to inherit Gold Toss and permanent passive MAG bonuses.",
      "Follower Bonds directly increase Archetype levels for that character's unique Archetype—maxing Hulkenberg's bond unlocks her Royal Knight Archetype EX skill 4 chapters earlier than grinding alone.",
      "Sub-Archetype assignment is as important as Main Archetype: physical attackers benefit from a Healer sub for MP recovery, while magic users need Warrior sub for equipment access to avoid elemental weaknesses.",
      "Enemy weaknesses in the overworld can be identified before battle by approaching from behind—unique icons on enemy models indicate their weakness element. Hitting weaknesses grants a Follow-Up Attack opportunity that deals 50% of a standard action's damage as a free action."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "MAG（強化資源）はゲーム内カレンダーで時間制限される。MAGファーミングダンジョンはストーリー期限日には行わず、次のストーリーダンジョン前の3日間をバッファとして確保する。",
      "アーキタイプ継承で、以前に習熟したアーキタイプのスキルを新しいものに引き継げる。第3章前にマーチャントを習熟（約15時間必要）し、ゴールドトスと永続MAGボーナスを継承する。",
      "フォロワーボンドはそのキャラクター固有アーキタイプのレベルに直接影響する。フルケンベルクのボンドを最大にすると、グラインド単独より4章早くロイヤルナイトのEXスキルが解放される。",
      "サブアーキタイプの割り当てはメイン同様重要。物理攻撃キャラにはMP回復のためのヒーラーサブ、魔法使いには属性弱点を避けるための装備アクセスのためのウォーリアーサブが効果的。",
      "野外の敵の弱点は後ろから接近することで戦闘前に特定できる。敵モデルのアイコンが弱点属性を示している。弱点を突くとフォローアップ攻撃の機会が発生し、標準行動の50%のダメージが追加行動として入る。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Early Calendar Priority",
        "body": "The first 7 calendar days are dense with mandatory story events. Insert MAG farming only on days 2 and 5 (confirmed free days in all routes). Use day 1 to unlock the Magla Transporter fast-travel pass by speaking to the Transporter NPC at the capital entrance—this saves 2–3 minutes per dungeon transit for the entire game. Prioritise the Seeker's Bond (Strohl) in the first week; it unlocks Sub-Archetype assignment 3 story events earlier than the default unlock."
      },
      {
        "title": "First Archetype Upgrade Path",
        "body": "Spend MAG in this order for the first 20 hours: Hero Archetype to Rank 5 (unlocks all base kit skills) → Merchant to Rank 3 (passive Gold income) → Mage to Rank 2 (AoE spell access for follow-up farming). Avoid spreading MAG across all Archetypes in the early game; concentrated investment in 2–3 Archetypes lets you unlock EX Skills earlier, which are disproportionately stronger than rank-for-rank investments across the full roster."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Dungeon Navigation and Foliore Engagement",
        "body": "Foliore (dungeon field enemies) have patrol routes that can be predicted and bypassed using the sprint-dodge mechanic. Entering combat from behind grants an Ambush bonus (+1 extra action for entire party). The ambush bonus stacks with Follow-Up Attacks from weakness hits, effectively giving a 3-action first turn against most non-boss encounters. This loop (ambush → weakness → follow-up) clears over 80% of standard dungeon encounters in a single turn at proper level."
      },
      {
        "title": "Election Route Strategy",
        "body": "The election system tracks approval ratings for each candidate—your party's actions in story events and follower bonds directly adjust these ratings. The Eupha and Hulkenberg Follower Bond paths provide the most election points per calendar day invested. Avoid the Grius route unless targeting a specific achievement; his path locks two other Follower Bonds from reaching max rank due to conflicting story events."
      },
      {
        "title": "MAG Farming Loop",
        "body": "The most time-efficient MAG farming dungeon is the Altabury Underground (available from Chapter 2). Route: Enter dungeon → clear Foliore clusters on floor B1 → exit and re-enter (resets spawns) → repeat. Each full B1 sweep yields 800–1200 MAG in 4–6 minutes. Equip the Collector Ring (Merchant Archetype Rank 7) to double MAG drops. At 1200 MAG/6min, a 30-minute farming session funds 2–3 full Archetype rank advances."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Final Archetype Compositions",
        "body": "The final boss sequence requires sustained damage across 5 phases without a rest opportunity. Recommended composition: Hero (Main) / Warrior (Sub) + Mage (Main) / Healer (Sub) + Knight (Main) / Brawler (Sub) + Merchant (Main) / Cleric (Sub). This composition covers all element types, maintains healing across at least 2 party members, and keeps the Merchant passive gold generation active for emergency item access. Bring 20+ Revival Beads and 15+ Mana Elixirs."
      },
      {
        "title": "Protagonist True Archetype",
        "body": "The Protagonist's unique final Archetype is unlocked by completing all 8 Royal Bond questlines before the final dungeon. Each Royal Bond is tied to a specific Follower—check the Bond menu before entering the final chapter. Missing a single Royal Bond locks the final Archetype until New Game Plus. The final Archetype's EX Skill deals the highest single-target damage in the game and ignores enemy resistance tiers, making it essential for the final phase."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Spreading MAG across every Archetype in the early game—the EX Skill unlock requires reaching Rank 8 in a single Archetype, and distributing investment delays this milestone by 6–10 calendar days.",
      "Skipping Follower Bond scenes to save calendar days—Bond scenes cost 1 calendar day but unlock Sub-Archetype slots, unique skills, and election points that cannot be obtained any other way.",
      "Ignoring enemy weakness icons on the overworld map—starting combat without knowing enemy weaknesses forfeits the Follow-Up Attack bonus, which is the primary source of turn efficiency in non-boss encounters.",
      "Not restocking items before dungeon entry—Metaphor's dungeon design places 3–4 floor clears between any rest opportunity; entering without full item stock effectively creates a timer on available resources.",
      "Attempting the final dungeon before all Royal Bonds are maxed—the final dungeon is 6+ floors with no exit opportunity after the midpoint. Enter only when the Bond list shows all 8 Royal Bonds at maximum rank."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "序盤に全アーキタイプへMAGを分散する。EXスキル解放にはランク8への到達が必要で、分散投資はこのマイルストーンを6〜10カレンダー日遅らせる。",
      "カレンダー日数節約のためにフォロワーボンドシーンをスキップする。ボンドシーンはカレンダー1日を消費するが、サブアーキタイプスロット、固有スキル、選挙ポイントを解放し、他の手段では入手不可。",
      "ワールドマップ上の敵弱点アイコンを無視する。弱点把握なしで戦闘を開始するとフォローアップ攻撃ボーナスを失い、非ボス戦闘の主要なターン効率源を放棄することになる。",
      "ダンジョン突入前にアイテムを補充しない。メタファーのダンジョン設計は休憩機会の間に3〜4フロアを設定しており、アイテム不足で実質的な資源タイマーが発生する。",
      "全ロイヤルボンドを最大化する前に最終ダンジョンに挑む。最終ダンジョンは中間点以降に脱出機会がない6フロア以上の構造。ボンドリストで8つのロイヤルボンドが全て最大ランクを示していることを確認してから突入する。"
    ]
